# From the Batch picker with the 「Sample Photos」 album open (R3-b, S23): pick its 8 photos, open the album list,
# choose 「00PHDa_Testing_Material」 and pick its tiles 2, 3, 4, 5 (red hair, red sweater, dog bed, dog in the office).
# Photo 1 = three women 1067-wide portrait, 12 photos in all. Ends on Batch Edit Room main screen.
tap 194 686
tap 540 686
tap 885 686
tap 194 1031
tap 540 1031
tap 885 1031
tap 194 1376
tap 540 1376
expect (8/20)
# The album list scrolls unevenly (scrollto cannot find album names there). R3-e: the album names were missing from the
# page source and `fingerdrag 600 1650 600 700` was taken as a tap; what worked: `tap 300 284`, `fingerdrag 700 1600 700 900 20`
# (00PHDa_Testing_Material then sits about y 1014-1492: screenshot and tap it by position), then go on from the waitfor.
tap 300 284
fingerdrag 600 1650 600 700
lbl 00PHDa_Testing_Material
waitfor "(8/20)" --timeout 5
tap 540 686
tap 885 686
tap 194 1031
tap 540 1031
expect (12/20)
lbl Next
waitfor "Crop & Rotate" --timeout 15
